We present to you update 0.18.314 (still in the prototyping stage). 

[h2]Full Changelog:[/h2]
[h3]Added:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fall damage;
[*] Fractured legs from a fall from a height;
[*] Turning the weapon away from the wall;
[/list]

[h3]Fixed:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Damage logic;
[*] Inventory logic after death;
[*] Animation of legs in a squat;
[*] Logic of the widget when looting/opening inventory;
[/list]

[h3]Restored:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Character's pockets in inventory;
[*] Footsteps sounds;
[/list]

[h3]Balance:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Melee/Punch damage;
[/list]

[h3]Technical changes:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Inventory system upgrade;
[*] Removed build warnings;
[*] Refactor animations, weapon;
[/list]

Thank you for your support and valuable feedback! We strive to make the game better!

We present to you update 0.18.301 for the game (still in the prototyping stage). In this update, a new arena map has been added, gameplay has been improved, and some bugs have been fixed.

[h2]Full Changelog:[/h2]
[h3]Added:[/h3]
[list]
[*] New arena map, replacing the old one (prototype; for testing);
[*] Exit systems from the game;
[*] Cooldown for melee weapons;
[*] Punch attacks;
[*] Radiation and exposure;
[/list]

[h3]Fixed:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Inventory system bugs;
[*] Character animation in the menu;
[*] Inventory widget functionality;
[*] Bug with saving user game settings;
[*] Melee weapon animations;
[*] Leg animations in idle stance;
[*] Weapon switching bug (partially);
[*] Weapon turn animations;
[/list]

[h3]Restored:[/h3]
[list]
[*]Aiming system;
[/list]

[h3]Technical changes:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Migration to version 5.4.2;
[*] Inventory system upgrade;
[/list]

Thank you for your support and valuable feedback! We strive to make the game better!

The project is getting better every day and is constantly being improved. 
The load is very large, so it was decided not to waste time on the news, but to do the main work further!

Recently there has been an emphasis on mechanics:
[list]
[*] melee weapons; 
[*] another reworking of animations;
[*] expanding the character's gaming capabilities;
[*] preparation of the arena.
[/list]

In the future, at least once a month, I will try to publish something here!
